# Run the API and send these one by one from Rider, VS or VS Code.
#   In memory:      dotnet run --project samples/Shop.Api
#   On PostgreSQL:  docker compose -f samples/Shop.Api/compose.yaml up -d
#                   ConnectionStrings__Wyrd="Host=localhost;Port=5433;Username=wyrd;Password=wyrd;Database=shop" dotnet run --project samples/Shop.Api -p:WyrdHost=EfCore
#   On PostgreSQL, stop and start the API at any point: every order continues where it was.
#   The /dev endpoints (journal, flaky gateway, clock) exist only in memory.
@api = http://localhost:5080

### 1. The warehouse receives 5 keyboards
POST {{api}}/stock/KEYBOARD
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 5 }

### 2. A customer places an order -> 202 Accepted
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "A-1001", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 89 }

### 3. The orders screen: A-1001 is Paid, waiting for the payment provider
GET {{api}}/orders

### 4. The payment provider confirms -> the order ships
POST {{api}}/webhooks/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "A-1001" }

### 5. The order, with its process status
GET {{api}}/orders/A-1001

### 6. Double click on "Buy" -> 409 AlreadyPlaced
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "A-1001", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 89 }

### 7. Card declined (over 1000) -> stock released, order Cancelled
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "A-1002", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 2500 }

### 8. Make the payment gateway flaky, then order: watch the retries in the journal (1s, 2s)
POST {{api}}/dev/payment-gateway/fail?times=2

###
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "A-1003", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 50 }

### 9. Nobody confirms A-1003: jump 15 minutes ahead -> timeout, refund, release
POST {{api}}/dev/clock/advance?minutes=15

### 10. Stock is consistent: 5 received - 1 shipped = 4
GET {{api}}/stock/KEYBOARD

### What happened, step by step
GET {{api}}/dev/journal

### Integration events other services would receive
GET {{api}}/dev/published

# Rich orders start as drafts. Amount is the total for the line, not a unit price.
# Lines are editable until submission. The existing fulfillment supports one SKU in EUR;
# a draft with several SKUs or another currency must be adjusted before submission.

### Add the first line: creates draft D-1001
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1001/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": "keyboard", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 89, "currency": "EUR" }

### Add another line with the same SKU
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1001/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": "extra", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 2, "amount": 100, "currency": "EUR" }

# Draft lines and total appear in details; order retains the existing fulfillment summary
# and is null until the draft is submitted.
### Inspect draft lines and their total
GET {{api}}/orders/D-1001

### A line in a different currency is rejected
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1001/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": "mixed", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 50, "currency": "USD" }

### Remove the extra line before submission
DELETE {{api}}/orders/D-1001/lines/extra

### Submit the draft: starts the same fulfillment as PlaceOrder
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1001/submit

### A placed order cannot have its lines changed
DELETE {{api}}/orders/D-1001/lines/keyboard

### Draft cancellation cannot cancel a placed order or bypass its compensation
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1001/cancel

### Confirm payment for the submitted draft
POST {{api}}/webhooks/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "D-1001" }

### Create another draft with several SKUs
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1002/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": "keyboard", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 89 }

###
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1002/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": "mouse", "sku": "MOUSE", "quantity": 1, "amount": 30 }

### Submission is rejected: multi-SKU fulfillment is not supported
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1002/submit

### Cancel the draft without starting fulfillment
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1002/cancel

### Cancelled orders cannot have lines added
POST {{api}}/orders/D-1002/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": "extra", "sku": "KEYBOARD", "quantity": 1, "amount": 50 }

### All order details, including drafts and cancelled drafts
GET {{api}}/order-details
